speechtext:
for leave to introduce Bill C-302, an act to amend the Criminal Code (offences against the foetus.)
He said: Mr. Speaker, as a member of Parliament, as a father and a grandfather, I believe very strongly in the sanctity of human life.
It is my commitment to the constituents in my riding to work to protect the rights of the unborn. That is the purpose of this bill. I am honoured to present it in this House today.
